="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_st;sig=可以通信;kind=gray;fillColor=#9ca3af;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p7-sig"><mxGeometry x="1133" y="644" width="98" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-166" value="Comm ready" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_st;sig=可以通信;kind=green;fillColor=#548235;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p7-sig"><mxGeometry x="1233" y="644" width="298" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-167" value="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=plc;sig=失败次数;kind=val;fr=1;fillColor=#f8d7d7;strokeColor=#c00000;fontColor=#c00000;" vertex="1" parent="p7-sig"><mxGeometry x="777" y="674" width="32" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-168" value="2" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=plc;sig=失败次数;kind=val;fr=1;fillColor=#f8d7d7;strokeColor=#c00000;fontColor=#c00000;" vertex="1" parent="p7-sig"><mxGeometry x="877" y="674" width="32" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-169" value="3" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=plc;sig=失败次数;kind=val;fr=1;fillColor=#f8d7d7;strokeColor=#c00000;fontColor=#c00000;" vertex="1" parent="p7-sig"><mxGeometry x="977" y="674" width="32" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-170" value="Error (latched)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=plc;sig=通信异常;kind=fault;fillColor=#c00000;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p7-sig"><mxGeometry x="977" y="704" width="416" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-171" value="Wait 30 s" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=plc;sig=启动等待;kind=val;fillColor=#f8d7d7;strokeColor=#c00000;fontColor=#c00000;" vertex="1" parent="p7-sig"><mxGeometry x="1133" y="734" width="98" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-172" value="[Notes]" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="778" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-173" value="※1 Timeout 1000 ms and 3 retries are common serial settings [I][P]. A request with no reply is followed directly by a &quot;none&quot; box, meaning it waited until the timeout; the fail count and the decision are drawn at that same moment." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="800" width="1524" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-174" value="※2 The heater has no comm watchdog, so after a link loss serial cannot stop it [I]. Remote power passes through the PLC [IO], so when the PLC flags a comm error it also outputs one remote power OFF by itself, and the heater stops by losing power [P, decided]." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="820" width="1524" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-175" value="※3 After the cut, the heater stays unpowered and the PLC stops polling; it is powered again only at the cleaner's next equipment start (remote power ON), then waits 30 s as in 1-1 [P]." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="840" width="1524" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-176" value="※4 A link loss on either side needs a reset: the major fault DO clears only when the cleaner resets after comm is back. Reset before the heater is up: the PLC does not clear it, the check at OFF fails → not cleared [P]." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="860" width="1524" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7-177" value="※5 3 consecutive &quot;data error&quot; NAKs, or 3 readback mismatches after a write, also count as a comm error with the same power cut (different alarm bit); a &quot;cannot execute now&quot; NAK does not count, the readback decides [P]. During the link loss the PLC keeps answering the cleaner's Modbus, so the cleaner does not raise a 485 error [P]." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p7-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="880" width="1524" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="chart-4-3" name="4-3 Cleaner-side link loss → reset"><mxGraphModel dx="1452" dy="708" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="0" arrows="0" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1452" pageHeight="708" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="p8-0"/><mxCell id="p8-table" value="Table" style="locked=1;" parent="p8-0"/><mxCell id="p8-sig" value="Signal" parent="p8-0"/><mxCell id="p8-1" value="4-3  Cleaner-side link loss → reset" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=18;fontColor=#1f3864;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="8" width="1432" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-2" value="This chart answers: When the cleaner cannot reach the PLC, who stops the heater, and how is it cleared after repair?" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=#374151;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="40" width="1432" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-3" value="Legend: [I] cleaner / heater side premise   [IO] IO assignment   [P] this PLC proposal   [?] not decided   [OK] decided   |   red dashed box &quot;none&quot; = no reply" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10;fontColor=#6b7280;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="66" width="1432" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-4" value="Group" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="0" y="96" width="112" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-5" value="Signal" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="112" y="96" width="180" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-6" value="Notes" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="292" y="96" width="340" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-7" value="①" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="632" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-8" value="Supplying" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="632" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-9" value="②" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="732" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-10" value="Link lost" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="732" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-11" value="③" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="832" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-12" value="Cleaner reads fail" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="832" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-13" value="④" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="932" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-14" value="PLC detects&#xa;link loss" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="932" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-15" value="⑤" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="1032" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-16" value="Cleaner stops" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="1032" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-17" value="⑥" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="1132" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-18" value="Line fixed" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="1132" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-19" value="⑦" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="1232" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-20" value="Reset ON (~5 s)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="1232" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-21" value="⑧" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="1332" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-22" value="Reset OFF · check" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="1332" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-23" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ededed;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="112" y="160" width="520" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-24" value="Alarm read error" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="112" y="160" width="180" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-25" value="[I] alarm after 3 failed reads, display only (no stop); cleared on screen unconditionally" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="292" y="160" width="340" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-26" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="632" y="190" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1432" y="190" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-27" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="112" y="190" width="520" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-28" value="Read alarms" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="112" y="190" width="180" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-29" value="[I] 500 ms; on no reply, the next read comes after the timeout" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="292" y="190" width="340" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-30" style="endArrow