ell><mxCell id="p8-127" value="Run off·No flow" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=6.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_out;sig=停止;kind=on;fillColor=#c55a11;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-sig"><mxGeometry x="933" y="374" width="58" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-128" value="Rdback" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=7.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_out;sig=状态读出 · 读回;kind=on;fr=1;fillColor=#c55a11;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-sig"><mxGeometry x="995" y="404" width="32" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-129" value="Re-read" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=6.9;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_out;sig=状态读出 · 读回;kind=on;fr=1;fillColor=#c55a11;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-sig"><mxGeometry x="1295" y="404" width="32" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-130" value="Error·Buzzer" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=7.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_out;sig=复位;kind=on;fillColor=#c55a11;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-sig"><mxGeometry x="1233" y="434" width="58" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-131" value="ACK ×2" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_in;sig=应答;kind=on;fillColor=#a07800;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-sig"><mxGeometry x="933" y="464" width="58" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-132" value="Match" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=9;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_in;sig=应答;kind=on;fr=1;fillColor=#a07800;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-sig"><mxGeometry x="995" y="464" width="32" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-133" value="ACK ×2" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_in;sig=应答;kind=on;fillColor=#a07800;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-sig"><mxGeometry x="1233" y="464" width="58" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-134" value="OK" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_in;sig=应答;kind=on;fr=1;fillColor=#a07800;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-sig"><mxGeometry x="1295" y="464" width="32" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-135" value="Running" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_st;sig=运转 · 入口阀 · 加热;kind=on;fillColor=#548235;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-sig"><mxGeometry x="633" y="494" width="298" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-136" value="Link lost" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=plc;sig=清洗机断线;kind=fault;fillColor=#c00000;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-sig"><mxGeometry x="933" y="524" width="208" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-137" value="[Notes]" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="568" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-138" value="※1 After 3 failed alarm reads the cleaner only shows &quot;alarm read error&quot;: display only, no stop [I]. So the PLC itself must detect the link loss and stop the heater [P]. The &quot;none&quot; box right after a request means the cleaner waits until the timeout before the next read." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="590" width="1424" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-139" value="※2 Time until the PLC declares a link loss: 5 s for now (500 ms × 10); not decided yet." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="628" width="1424" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-140" value="※3 If the cleaner writes a temp during the link loss (supply start / stop), it raises &quot;temp set error&quot; → hot water stop [I]." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="648" width="1424" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8-141" value="※4 A link loss on either side needs a reset: even after the line is fixed, the major fault DO clears only on reset [P]. The cleaner's own &quot;alarm read error&quot; is cleared on the screen unconditionally [I]." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p8-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="668" width="1424" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="chart-4-4" name="4-4 PLC itself loses power / stops → restart → reset"><mxGraphModel dx="1452" dy="846" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="0" arrows="0" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1452" pageHeight="846" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="p9-0"/><mxCell id="p9-table" value="Table" style="locked=1;" parent="p9-0"/><mxCell id="p9-sig" value="Signal" parent="p9-0"/><mxCell id="p9-1" value="4-4  PLC itself loses power / stops → restart → reset" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=18;fontColor=#1f3864;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="8" width="1432" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-2" value="This chart answers: When the PLC loses power or stops, what happens to the cleaner and the heater; how does it recover when the PLC comes back?" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=#374151;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="40" width="1432" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-3" value="Legend: [I] cleaner / heater side premise   [IO] IO assignment   [P] this PLC proposal   [?] not decided   [OK] decided   |   red dashed box &quot;none&quot; = no reply" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10;fontColor=#6b7280;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="66" width="1432" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-4" value="Group" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="0" y="96" width="112" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-5" value="Signal" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="112" y="96" width="180" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-6" value="Notes" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="292" y="96" width="340" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-7" value="①" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="632" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-8" value="Supplying" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="632" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-9" value="②" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="732" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-10" value="PLC power off / stop" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="732" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-11" value="③" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="832" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-12" value="Cleaner sees&#xa;fault · stops" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="832" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-13" value="④" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="932" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-14" value="Cleaner alarm&#xa;reads fail" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="932" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-15" value="⑤" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="1032" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-16" value="PLC runs again" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="1032" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-17" value="⑥" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="1132" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-18" value="PLC reads heater · resends stop" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="1132" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-19" value="⑦" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="1232" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-20" value="Reset ON (~5 s)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="1232" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-21" value="⑧" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=13;fillColor=#1f3864;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="1332" y="96" width="100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-22" value="Reset OFF · check" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#dde4f0;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="1332" y="122" width="100" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-23" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ededed;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="112" y="160" width="520" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-24" value="Temp set error" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="112" y="160" width="180" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-25" value="[I] 3 failed temp writes → cycle stop, hot water stop" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="292" y="160" width="340" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-26" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="632" y="190" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1432" y="190" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-27" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ededed;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="112" y="190" width="520" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-28" value="Alarm read error" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="112" y="190" width="180" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-29" value="[I] 3 failed alarm reads → display only" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="292" y="190" width="340" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-30" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="632" y="220" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1432" y="220" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-31" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="112" y="220" width="520" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-32" value="Run / flow" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="112" y="220" width="180" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-33" value="[I] OFF on seeing the major fault" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="292" y="220" width="340" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-34" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="632" y="250" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1432" y="250" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-35" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="112" y="250" width="520" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-36" value="Write temp" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="112" y="250" width="180" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-37" value="[I] writes 25.0 when stopping" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="292" y="250" width="340" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-38" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="632" y="280" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1432" y="280" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-39" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ddebf7;strokeColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="112" y="280" width="520" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-40" value="Read alarms" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="112" y="280" width="180" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-41" value="[I] 500 ms; on no reply, the next read comes after the timeout" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="292" y="280" width="340" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-42" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry re