cing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_out;sig=状态读出 · 读回;kind=on;fr=1;fillColor=#c55a11;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-sig"><mxGeometry x="683" y="494" width="32" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-140" value="Read" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_out;sig=状态读出 · 读回;kind=on;fr=1;fillColor=#c55a11;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-sig"><mxGeometry x="1133" y="494" width="32" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-141" value="Rdback" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=7.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_out;sig=状态读出 · 读回;kind=on;fr=1;fillColor=#c55a11;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-sig"><mxGeometry x="1199" y="494" width="32" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-142" value="Re-read" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=6.9;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_out;sig=状态读出 · 读回;kind=on;fr=1;fillColor=#c55a11;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-sig"><mxGeometry x="1295" y="494" width="32" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-143" value="Stop ×3" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=6;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_out;sig=停止 3 帧;kind=on;fillColor=#c55a11;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-sig"><mxGeometry x="1168" y="524" width="28" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-144" value="Error·Buzzer" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=7.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_out;sig=复位;kind=on;fillColor=#c55a11;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-sig"><mxGeometry x="1233" y="554" width="58" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-145" value="Reply" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=9.7;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_in;sig=应答;kind=on;fr=1;fillColor=#a07800;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-sig"><mxGeometry x="683" y="584" width="32" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-146" value="Reply" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=9.7;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_in;sig=应答;kind=on;fr=1;fillColor=#a07800;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-sig"><mxGeometry x="1133" y="584" width="32" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-147" value="ACK ×3" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=6.1;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_in;sig=应答;kind=on;fillColor=#a07800;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-sig"><mxGeometry x="1168" y="584" width="28" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-148" value="Match" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=9;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_in;sig=应答;kind=on;fr=1;fillColor=#a07800;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-sig"><mxGeometry x="1199" y="584" width="32" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-149" value="ACK ×2" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_in;sig=应答;kind=on;fillColor=#a07800;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-sig"><mxGeometry x="1233" y="584" width="58" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-150" value="OK" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_in;sig=应答;kind=on;fr=1;fillColor=#a07800;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-sig"><mxGeometry x="1295" y="584" width="32" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-151" value="Keeps running (can't stop)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=su_st;sig=运转 · 入口阀 · 加热;kind=on;fillColor=#548235;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-sig"><mxGeometry x="633" y="614" width="533" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-152" value="RUN" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=plc;sig=PLC 运行;kind=green;fillColor=#548235;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-sig"><mxGeometry x="633" y="644" width="98" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-153" value="STOP / power off" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=plc;sig=PLC 运行;kind=fault;fillColor=#c00000;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-sig"><mxGeometry x="733" y="644" width="298" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-154" value="RUN" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=10.5;spacing=0;tl=bar;zone=plc;sig=PLC 运行;kind=green;fillColor=#548235;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-sig"><mxGeometry x="1033" y="644" width="398" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-155" value="[Notes]" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="10" y="688" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-156" value="※1 Fault DOs are NC (b) contacts: when the PLC loses power or stops, the contacts open and the cleaner sees major and minor fault at once, with nothing needed from the PLC. Drawn as logic (red = alarm)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="710" width="1424" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-157" value="※2 On the cleaner side after the PLC stops: 3 failed alarm reads → &quot;alarm read error&quot;, display only; 3 failed temp writes → &quot;temp set error&quot; → hot water stop [I]. The &quot;none&quot; box right after a request means waiting until the timeout." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="730" width="1424" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-158" value="※3 The heater has no comm watchdog, so it keeps running in its last state even if the PLC stops. Remote power ON / OFF also goes through the PLC [IO], so while the PLC is stopped the cleaner's power cut does not reach the heater. There is no E-stop; this goes into the risk assessment (decided; the item still has to be added)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="750" width="1424" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9-159" value="※4 When the PLC restarts, remote power is already ON: the heater is powered, so the PLC reads right away without waiting 30 s [P]. After the PLC runs again: it reads the heater status once and resends stop according to the cleaner's current run / flow; the fault DOs stay in alarm, the cleaner's alarm reads also get &quot;alarm&quot;, and it clears on the cleaner's reset (a PLC stop also counts as a link loss and needs a reset too) [P]." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=2;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p9-table"><mxGeometry x="14" y="788" width="1424" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
